          "title": "The phrase, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "دیوار گھڑی (dīvār ghaṛī) joins dīvār, \"wall\", usually traced to Persian dīvār, and ghaṛī, \"clock\", from Sanskrit ghaṭī, \"pot, water-clock\" (CDIAL 4406). A ghaṭī was a small pot that sank as it filled, timing a short period."
            }
